WEBVTT

01:40.570 --> 01:44.220
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.050 --> 01:47.310
[Episode 36]

02:03.280 --> 02:04.680
You have no idea who you're up against.

02:04.790 --> 02:05.870
Listen up,

02:06.150 --> 02:08.360
the only way you're entering this door

02:08.520 --> 02:11.470
is over my dead body.

02:22.800 --> 02:24.680
Mei Shan, how are you holding up?

02:25.970 --> 02:27.680
This barely counts as warm-up exercise for me.

02:27.710 --> 02:29.240
You came here too early.

02:29.790 --> 02:31.790
Okay. Keep it on then.

02:31.910 --> 02:33.590
Let's kick this woman to hell together!

03:07.520 --> 03:08.870
What a bunch of losers.

03:09.680 --> 03:11.150
I'd love to see

03:11.190 --> 03:12.840
how tough you can be.

03:15.680 --> 03:18.000
You are just lowly mortals.

03:18.960 --> 03:21.240
Want to turn the tables?

03:35.380 --> 03:36.470
It'll never happen for you!

03:46.570 --> 03:48.530
Don't you underestimate me!

03:49.480 --> 03:51.079
Nobody can

03:51.120 --> 03:53.280
tear me apart.

03:53.280 --> 03:54.390
You think I'd fear you?

03:55.150 --> 03:56.430
As a goddess,

03:57.000 --> 03:58.430
a little setback is enough

03:58.430 --> 04:00.280
to turn you into a destroyer of the world.

04:00.710 --> 04:02.800
Don't you think you need more heavenly tribulations?

04:03.400 --> 04:05.960
It's so unfair that you could become a goddess.

04:06.540 --> 04:08.490
The Gate of Heaven kept me out

04:08.520 --> 04:10.000
for four whole decades.

04:10.150 --> 04:11.960
Every 49 days,

04:12.150 --> 04:13.710
I had to go through a heavenly tribulation.

04:13.870 --> 04:14.710
In total,

04:14.710 --> 04:16.160
5,362 tribulations of lightning

04:16.160 --> 04:17.310
befell me.

04:17.310 --> 04:18.829
Today, on behalf of the heavenly realm,

04:18.829 --> 04:20.480
I'll teach you a lesson,

04:20.480 --> 04:21.800
so you'll know this:

04:21.800 --> 04:24.630
trouble finds those who don't deserve what they have!

04:25.120 --> 04:26.040
You're dead meat!

05:10.630 --> 05:11.430
Mei Shan.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.480
Are you okay?

05:22.750 --> 05:23.560
Don't worry.

05:25.510 --> 05:26.510
This woman

05:27.300 --> 05:28.740
is not going to succeed.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.870
The human body

05:42.390 --> 05:43.790
is cleverly designed.

05:44.290 --> 05:46.050
It contains the divine power of heaven and earth.

05:46.830 --> 05:48.920
It is intricately beautiful.

05:49.600 --> 05:51.120
It is foolish of you

05:52.400 --> 05:54.290
to look down on mortals.

06:00.310 --> 06:01.120
Mei Shan.

06:10.190 --> 06:11.000
Today

06:12.180 --> 06:14.690
marks the first day I became a god.

06:15.630 --> 06:17.480
I had such a good fight.

06:22.750 --> 06:24.040
I'm only wondering

06:25.600 --> 06:28.360
if I'm a match for Yuanzhong.

07:07.510 --> 07:09.360
You talk about doing good, but you never do.

07:09.360 --> 07:11.310
You talk about morality, but you have none.

07:11.310 --> 07:12.800
You talk about justice, but you renounce it.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.310
That's what mortals such as yourselves do!

07:15.120 --> 07:18.050
You're conniving and ungrateful hypocrites.

07:18.190 --> 07:19.510
All of you should die!

07:29.760 --> 07:30.430
Yuanzhong!

07:31.680 --> 07:32.470
Yuanzhong!

07:47.210 --> 07:47.920
Where is the demon?

07:51.290 --> 07:52.100
Where is the Demon Lord?

07:58.600 --> 07:59.600
The demon is dead?

08:01.480 --> 08:02.510
Are you surprised?

08:21.560 --> 08:23.160
I should've known it.

08:25.750 --> 08:27.270
I should've known it.

08:27.950 --> 08:29.440
Useless crap.

08:30.070 --> 08:33.080
It originated from Taihe's malice.

08:33.440 --> 08:34.659
No wonder it's a loser!

08:35.440 --> 08:36.440
Hannv,

08:36.909 --> 08:38.360
you don't stand a chance of winning.

08:38.549 --> 08:39.480
Stop it now.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.670
Stop? How can I stop?

08:44.670 --> 08:46.390
As long as you stop fighting us,

08:46.670 --> 08:47.910
go to the Discipline Hall with me,

08:48.030 --> 08:49.550
and receive punishment from the five preceptors,

08:49.720 --> 08:51.240
I'll plead for you.

08:54.320 --> 08:56.360
You are so naive.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.320
Receive punishment?

08:59.360 --> 09:00.790
From whom?

09:02.240 --> 09:04.600
Those five old fools in Discipline Hall?

09:06.030 --> 09:08.210
Every day, they get on their high horse,

09:08.240 --> 09:09.210
preaching and prattling.

09:09.230 --> 09:10.990
What do they know about suffering?

09:12.240 --> 09:14.190
You say I'm wrong.

09:15.570 --> 09:16.620
Then what about him?

09:18.870 --> 09:20.670
He also wants to destroy the world.

09:20.670 --> 09:22.320
Is he any different than me?

09:22.320 --> 09:24.030
Yuanzhong once lost his way,

09:24.240 --> 09:25.390
but he came to his senses in time,

09:25.390 --> 09:27.150
and barely caused damage.

09:27.530 --> 09:28.370
By contrast,

09:28.630 --> 09:30.000
because of your own vendetta,

09:30.030 --> 09:31.000
you released the Demon Lord,

09:31.000 --> 09:32.390
and started the war between the gods and demons,

09:32.390 --> 09:33.910
which harmed every creature alive.

09:34.320 --> 09:36.670
How could you compare yourself with him?

09:36.740 --> 09:37.790
Nonsense.

09:40.150 --> 09:40.870
You're only

09:40.870 --> 09:42.200
defending him

09:42.200 --> 09:43.320
because you like him.

09:44.670 --> 09:46.670
I don't believe you will end his life

09:47.000 --> 09:48.840
if he commits terrible crime.

09:49.510 --> 09:50.320
I will.

10:20.030 --> 10:21.670
The day I became a goddess,

10:21.670 --> 10:23.670
the sun was also

10:24.510 --> 10:26.790
scorching like this.

10:29.150 --> 10:31.270
It was even hotter

10:31.270 --> 10:33.080
than the fire burning my body.

10:35.000 --> 10:37.550
Chu stood far away from me,

10:38.200 --> 10:39.510
with her face buried in her hands.

10:41.080 --> 10:43.080
I thought she was crying for me.

10:48.570 --> 10:52.180
Even the closest family members are not trustworthy.

10:53.480 --> 10:55.240
What's the meaning of

10:56.120 --> 10:57.510
the mortal world's existence?

10:58.790 --> 10:59.840
Hannv.

11:05.930 --> 11:06.840
Forget it.

11:10.440 --> 11:11.910
All is unfair to me.

11:13.360 --> 11:14.790
A world like this

11:15.550 --> 11:17.320
should cease to be.

11:28.870 --> 11:29.670
Look!

11:35.250 --> 11:36.970
She's turning Fangwai Mountain into a piece of embroidery.

11:41.240 --> 11:42.030
Stop her!

11:52.150 --> 11:53.150
There are other people on the mountain.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.220
Guys, go rescue them.

12:07.030 --> 12:08.320
Tanyin, run!

12:12.850 --> 12:13.780
Hannv,

12:13.830 --> 12:14.870
leave with me.

12:22.870 --> 12:24.030
The clock is ticking.

12:27.080 --> 12:30.240
I wish you were truly my sister.

12:33.410 --> 12:36.200
I beg you. Please leave with me, will you?

12:58.580 --> 12:59.940
[Hall of Elders]

14:42.030 --> 14:45.320
Bravo! Bravo!

15:02.730 --> 15:05.070
[Dengyun House]

15:06.630 --> 15:10.120
That was a fierce battle.

15:10.360 --> 15:12.910
Everything was turned upside down.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.670
The sky was dark as if it was night.

15:14.810 --> 15:18.050
The world was plagued by demons. Even mountains fell.

15:19.200 --> 15:20.510
In order to kill

15:20.630 --> 15:23.120
the Demon Lord that had nine heads and twelve wings,

15:23.170 --> 15:26.410
countless prominent humans,

15:26.600 --> 15:27.640
Youhu members,

15:27.670 --> 15:30.040
and War Demons lost their lives.

15:30.580 --> 15:31.870
There is a poem as proof.

15:32.270 --> 15:34.600
Force troops stationed at the borders by dawn.

15:34.720 --> 15:37.480
Soldiers in armor were covered by sand, waiting.

15:37.620 --> 15:39.580
The drum was not beating yet.

15:39.920 --> 15:42.650
Crows and eagles already arrived to celebrate.

15:43.390 --> 15:45.510
Well said!

15:45.750 --> 15:46.870
This is not right.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.480
Didn't you previously say

15:48.550 --> 15:49.840
the three clans fought together

15:49.840 --> 15:51.630
against the demons on Fangwai Mountain?

15:51.630 --> 15:54.240
That place is surrounded

15:54.240 --> 15:55.320
by lush hills,

15:55.320 --> 15:57.550
unlike the desolate border areas, isn't it?

15:57.550 --> 15:59.240
-Yes!
-Right?

15:59.320 --> 16:00.120
My friend,

16:00.390 --> 16:02.750
ignore those trivialities.

16:03.390 --> 16:06.270
You should picture the tragic scene instead.

16:06.940 --> 16:10.100
Wasn't that war terrible?

16:11.080 --> 16:11.960
The war went on.

16:11.960 --> 16:14.120
With the joint efforts made by the three clans,

16:14.140 --> 16:18.070
the Demon Lord was finally eliminated on Fangwai Mountain.

16:18.790 --> 16:21.440
At that time, the leaders of the three clans

16:21.600 --> 16:25.510
got over their feuds and made peace.

16:26.010 --> 16:28.720
In front of the Demon Lord's dead body,

16:29.000 --> 16:33.550
they made an oath with their blood,

16:34.720 --> 16:37.870
promising that the three clans

16:37.870 --> 16:41.030
would stay in unity,

16:41.080 --> 16:44.510
help those in need, share sorrows and happiness together,

16:45.030 --> 16:48.670
maintain the same standards of good and bad, and respect one another's sovereignty.

16:48.670 --> 16:50.270
No invasion was allowed.

16:50.750 --> 16:55.380
They vowed to uphold these principles forever.

16:55.960 --> 16:59.240
Bravo! Bravo!

17:00.870 --> 17:02.400
It is said that Goddess Wushuang

17:02.420 --> 17:03.500
is actually the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

17:03.520 --> 17:04.760
Is it true?

17:05.240 --> 17:06.270
Is it true?

17:06.440 --> 17:07.440
Is it true?

17:07.720 --> 17:10.030
My friend, I'm just a storyteller.

17:10.030 --> 17:11.880
Up till now,

17:11.950 --> 17:13.470
it has been over one thousand years

17:13.490 --> 17:15.270
since Goddess Wushuang became a goddess.

17:15.270 --> 17:17.550
The Mute Lady of Wu Mountain's travels

17:17.880 --> 17:20.310
happened more than one hundred years ago.

17:20.550 --> 17:21.960
How am I supposed to answer your question?

17:26.480 --> 17:28.480
You're not making this easy for me, are you?

17:31.310 --> 17:33.970
As a storyteller,

17:34.000 --> 17:36.270
I make money by telling stories.

17:36.790 --> 17:38.180
Each and every one of you

17:38.670 --> 17:41.280
is my patron.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.960
If there's something you want to hear,

17:43.070 --> 17:44.270
I'm supposed

17:44.270 --> 17:46.550
to tell you every bit I know.

17:46.550 --> 17:47.440
I'm just afraid

17:47.440 --> 17:49.480
that it would take too much of your time.

17:49.510 --> 17:51.200
I have done a lot of research

17:51.200 --> 17:52.240
about the legend

17:52.760 --> 17:55.150
of the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

17:55.880 --> 17:57.680
Then tell us about it. Spit it out!

17:57.680 --> 17:58.960
Tell us now!

18:00.030 --> 18:00.880
You are

18:00.880 --> 18:03.110
more passionate than I expected.

18:03.200 --> 18:05.240
This gentleman has crossed the line

18:05.270 --> 18:07.240
by hitting me with a big lump of silver.

18:07.240 --> 18:11.130
It's hard not to take it personal, isn't it?

18:14.200 --> 18:20.540
[Qin'an Hall]

18:35.030 --> 18:36.110
Mr. Tanghua.

18:36.680 --> 18:37.480
Where is Zhi Dai?

18:38.000 --> 18:39.240
Young City Lord Zhi Dai

18:39.240 --> 18:41.240
passed the position of city lord to me,

18:41.720 --> 18:43.440
and left Yandu City.

18:44.180 --> 18:44.980
Where has she gone?

18:49.350 --> 18:50.310
I don't know.

18:51.400 --> 18:52.680
She was badly injured.

18:53.070 --> 18:55.350
She only told me that she planned to recover

18:55.350 --> 18:56.550
at a warm place.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.110
Come in.

19:34.250 --> 19:36.490
Chief Tanghua already left.

19:39.700 --> 19:40.980
Are you sure not to meet him

19:41.240 --> 19:42.590
for one more time?

19:43.240 --> 19:44.960
Apart from being meaningless,

19:46.020 --> 19:47.810
it would only mess with our minds.

20:23.950 --> 20:24.740
Tanghua!

20:24.200 --> 20:27.370
[Yandu City]

20:27.550 --> 20:29.000
Did I upset you or what?

20:29.200 --> 20:30.960
You didn't reply to my letter or invitation.

20:30.990 --> 20:31.990
We've bumped into each other now.

20:32.020 --> 20:32.940
Are you still pretending not to see me?

20:33.550 --> 20:34.350
What do you want?

20:35.110 --> 20:35.830
In a few days,

20:35.830 --> 20:36.550
a ceremony to celebrate

20:36.550 --> 20:37.750
me becoming chief will be held.

20:37.750 --> 20:38.590
Are you coming or not?

20:40.590 --> 20:41.880
You're chief of Youhu Clan.

20:41.880 --> 20:42.700
You must come.

20:43.030 --> 20:44.550
Shen Ying and I have arranged

20:44.720 --> 20:45.920
for the three clans to sign a convention

20:45.920 --> 20:46.880
of alliance in Gushan.

20:47.270 --> 20:48.160
You have to be there.

20:49.310 --> 20:50.590
Elder Xinyao will be there

20:50.790 --> 20:51.910
on my behalf.

20:54.830 --> 20:55.920
Have you still not found Zhi Dai yet?

20:56.550 --> 20:57.350
No.

20:57.990 --> 20:58.860
In my opinion,

20:58.960 --> 21:00.550
Zhi Dai is avoiding you on purpose.

21:00.830 --> 21:01.600
I know.

21:02.160 --> 21:03.240
Then why are you still looking for her?

21:04.550 --> 21:05.350
I insist.

21:08.510 --> 21:09.680
Do you need my help?

21:11.000 --> 21:13.240
No. I'm leaving now.

21:15.320 --> 21:16.730
Are you really not coming to Gushan?

21:16.960 --> 21:18.350
What if Zhi Dai shows up?

21:30.720 --> 21:32.350
Today, I went passed River Temple.

21:32.640 --> 21:33.790
I plan to sleep on the mountain peak.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.110
This place is quiet and peaceful.

21:37.090 --> 21:38.960
I can see many stars when I look up.

21:39.550 --> 21:41.030
They seem to be within my reach.

21:41.960 --> 21:43.310
How I wish I could get a star,

21:44.000 --> 21:45.400
and attach it to this letter for you.

21:53.380 --> 21:58.560
[City Lord's Mansion]

22:16.270 --> 22:17.070
Over these years,

22:17.640 --> 22:19.350
I've walked the paths you walked.

22:20.160 --> 22:21.640
I've seen the vast rivers in the south,

22:22.000 --> 22:23.240
above which lay fleecy clouds.

22:23.590 --> 22:25.110
I've seen the deserts in the east.

22:25.550 --> 22:26.830
The clouds there seemed to be frozen.

22:27.640 --> 22:29.030
I've seen the famous waterfalls in the south.

22:29.550 --> 22:30.880
How magnificent.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.200
I've even visited

22:32.200 --> 22:33.750
utterly steep cliffs.

22:34.510 --> 22:35.480
I've seen the views

22:36.110 --> 22:38.200
you saw in those years of loneliness.

22:39.390 --> 22:42.210
♫I gaze into your deep eyes♫

22:39.680 --> 22:41.200
I once chatted with travelers

22:41.550 --> 22:42.510
in a hotel in the forest

22:42.510 --> 22:44.110
about mortals' romance.

22:43.960 --> 22:47.440
♫For whom do you take apart the word "love"?♫

22:45.000 --> 22:46.790
I once wandered in a deserted place,

22:47.240 --> 22:49.550
and had a drink with nature as my only friend.

22:50.200 --> 22:52.900
♫Turning around, it's like a dream♫

22:50.480 --> 22:51.750
It was a celebration for me having

22:52.590 --> 22:54.240
a sorrowful experience in the mortal world.

22:54.600 --> 22:58.540
♫I have betrayed deep love♫

22:56.510 --> 22:58.000
I followed your footprints,

22:58.270 --> 22:59.720
saw this huge world,

23:00.590 --> 23:02.110
and experienced a mortal's difficulty during travels.

23:00.900 --> 23:03.740
♫Heaving a long, helpless sigh♫

23:02.750 --> 23:04.240
But I keep thinking I'm still far from

23:04.240 --> 23:05.440
having the feelings you had.

23:05.730 --> 23:09.670
♫Time flies too rapidly♫

23:06.480 --> 23:07.400
That said,

23:08.000 --> 23:09.880
I have finally made up

23:09.960 --> 23:10.960
for all the lost time.

23:12.000 --> 23:15.050
♫Life is like a flying bird♫

23:12.070 --> 23:14.160
What wasn't completed in the first half of my life has been done.

23:16.230 --> 23:21.120
♫Joining, scattering, no way back♫

23:16.400 --> 23:17.960
Tomorrow, as the sun rises,

23:18.550 --> 23:20.640
I will go back to the starting point of everything,

23:21.590 --> 23:22.830
namely the maple woods by the river

23:22.100 --> 23:25.240
♫Unable to get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

23:22.830 --> 23:24.240
where we first met.

23:25.550 --> 23:27.070
I want to ask you again

23:27.630 --> 23:30.720
♫When I brush past love fate is set♫

23:27.720 --> 23:29.240
about your name.

23:30.350 --> 23:31.160
This time,

23:32.000 --> 23:34.110
I assure you I will always keep it in mind.

23:32.430 --> 23:34.590
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

23:34.270 --> 23:35.880
I won't forget it.

23:35.820 --> 23:37.710
♫I couldn't describe♫

23:38.480 --> 23:41.550
Autumn is about to end. The moon will be full again.

23:38.620 --> 23:42.900
♫This lovesick path with you♫

23:42.750 --> 23:43.830
I wish I can

23:43.080 --> 23:44.820
♫After the farewell, where are you now?♫

23:44.590 --> 23:46.000
spend time with you again.

23:44.840 --> 23:48.130
♫Who do you spend your days with?♫

23:48.690 --> 23:53.650
♫Do you know I'm willing to wait for you until the end?♫

23:54.450 --> 23:57.090
♫Sighing that the world is too lonely♫

23:57.210 --> 23:59.680
♫They laugh at me for being foolish♫

24:00.250 --> 24:04.310
♫Longing is in my song; the people are not as before♫

24:05.640 --> 24:09.140
♫Unable to get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

24:11.180 --> 24:15.190
♫When I brush past love, fate is set♫

24:16.070 --> 24:18.070
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

24:19.010 --> 24:21.880
♫But I can't describe♫

24:22.280 --> 24:26.050
♫This lovesick path♫

24:27.040 --> 24:34.270
♫People are not as they were in this lifetime♫

24:30.660 --> 24:33.640
[Zhao's Noodle Restaurant]

24:32.750 --> 24:33.780
Enjoy.

24:35.640 --> 24:36.440
Well...

24:38.580 --> 24:39.730
Miss Ji, Mr. Yuan,

24:39.750 --> 24:40.510
glad to meet you.

24:40.510 --> 24:42.310
Your business is going great, Mr. Zhao.

24:42.640 --> 24:43.720
It all thanks to the customers.

24:43.880 --> 24:44.720
Please come in.

24:44.780 --> 24:45.460
The same old table.

24:45.480 --> 24:46.670
I've been reserving it for you.

24:48.310 --> 24:49.110
Miss Ji,

24:49.270 --> 24:51.920
thanks to the convention signed by the three clans,

24:52.210 --> 24:52.980
members of all clans

24:53.000 --> 24:54.840
like doing business in Yandu City now.

24:54.930 --> 24:56.800
Our lives are getting better.

24:57.640 --> 24:58.510
This morning,

24:58.540 --> 24:59.670
I just saw two

24:59.690 --> 25:01.320
War Demon brothers off.

25:01.350 --> 25:02.750
They're smart

25:03.080 --> 25:04.840
businessmen.

25:04.880 --> 25:06.550
Yeah. This afternoon,

25:06.630 --> 25:07.520
I just closed a big deal

25:07.540 --> 25:08.690
with some War Demons.

25:09.160 --> 25:10.830
It'll keep me busy for the next six months.

25:11.900 --> 25:12.700
If

25:13.310 --> 25:15.270
you watch out for each other,

25:15.400 --> 25:17.830
keep an open mind and treat each other nicely,

25:18.110 --> 25:19.440
your lives will be better and better.

25:20.200 --> 25:21.830
Miss Ji is right.

25:21.880 --> 25:23.510
Please wait a moment. I will bring noodles to you soon.

25:24.640 --> 25:25.510
Have you heard?

25:25.640 --> 25:26.510
Recently, Youhu Clan

25:26.510 --> 25:27.750
has started to recruit female disciples.

25:27.960 --> 25:28.750
Female disciples?

25:29.880 --> 25:31.000
They call them disciples,

25:31.000 --> 25:32.270
but in fact, those are just maids

25:32.270 --> 25:33.510
and servants.

25:33.590 --> 25:34.720
The same thing happened before.

25:34.760 --> 25:35.760
It's not news.

25:36.270 --> 25:37.070
Yeah.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.070
But it's different this time.

25:38.070 --> 25:39.030
Word has it

25:39.160 --> 25:40.480
that Youhu Clan plans to recruit many new disciples,

25:40.480 --> 25:41.510
and really teach them.

25:41.590 --> 25:42.830
Any War Demon

25:42.830 --> 25:43.880
and human

25:43.960 --> 25:45.480
admitted to Fangwai Mountain

25:45.510 --> 25:47.000
will be given chances to study

25:47.000 --> 25:48.240
the magic tricks of Youhu Clan.

25:49.550 --> 25:50.680
-Really?
-Is it true?

25:50.810 --> 25:51.610
Where are you going?

25:51.790 --> 25:52.750
I'll go get more information.

25:52.750 --> 25:53.680
I'll be back soon.

25:53.680 --> 25:54.480
But the noodles...

25:54.580 --> 25:56.240
-I'll go too!
-Let's go, guys.

26:00.270 --> 26:02.350
Where do you want to go next?

26:05.880 --> 26:07.200
Nowhere.

26:09.350 --> 26:10.400
Over the past six months,

26:10.830 --> 26:12.590
we've been to so many places.

26:13.000 --> 26:14.110
I'm a bit tired.

26:17.130 --> 26:18.020
Why don't we

26:18.830 --> 26:20.350
go to Fragrant House?

26:20.990 --> 26:22.170
I miss Curly.

26:25.380 --> 26:26.030
Okay.

26:26.920 --> 26:28.480
Here are your noodles.

26:30.030 --> 26:31.000
This bowl is yours.

26:31.000 --> 26:31.640
Thank you.

26:31.640 --> 26:32.550
And this is yours.

26:32.920 --> 26:33.720
Thank you.

26:33.720 --> 26:34.590
Enjoy.

27:01.690 --> 27:05.250
[Yandu City]

27:35.920 --> 27:36.720
Yuanzhong,

27:38.110 --> 27:39.920
let's take a rest over there.

27:40.950 --> 27:41.720
Okay.

28:15.550 --> 28:16.350
Tanyin,

28:17.880 --> 28:19.240
previously in Master Yan's Mansion,

28:20.710 --> 28:22.100
when you took the divine bone out of yourself,

28:23.310 --> 28:24.110
did it hurt?

28:26.490 --> 28:27.200
No.

28:28.960 --> 28:29.750
That's a lie.

28:31.500 --> 28:33.180
When I reattached the divine hand,

28:33.800 --> 28:35.040
I felt so much pain.

28:36.360 --> 28:37.840
How could you not feel hurt

28:38.750 --> 28:40.030
when you took a bone out of your body?

28:42.350 --> 28:43.640
Though the bone is detached,

28:45.200 --> 28:46.550
the marrow stays.

28:47.550 --> 28:48.400
The divine bone

28:49.580 --> 28:51.780
represents my identity as a goddess,

28:52.640 --> 28:54.400
and the recognition of the heavenly way.

28:56.880 --> 28:57.680
It is not

28:57.680 --> 28:59.070
a real bone.

29:06.590 --> 29:07.400
Yuanzhong,

29:11.790 --> 29:12.640
were you

29:14.160 --> 29:15.790
mad at me?

29:18.240 --> 29:19.880
I spent a long time trying to wake you up

29:20.310 --> 29:21.720
in your sea of consciousness,

29:23.350 --> 29:25.000
but you didn't come to.

29:26.830 --> 29:27.720
It was not like that.

29:29.640 --> 29:31.240
As soon as I heard your voice,

29:31.640 --> 29:32.920
I really wanted to respond.

29:33.590 --> 29:34.590
But at that time,

29:34.610 --> 29:35.890
I couldn't control myself.

29:36.440 --> 29:37.480
My eyes just wouldn't open.

29:38.350 --> 29:39.720
When I was about to disappear,

29:41.240 --> 29:42.480
a green lotus popped up

29:42.480 --> 29:43.550
before my eyes.

29:44.880 --> 29:46.880
It blossomed and released enormous power,

29:47.830 --> 29:49.590
which helped me wake up.

29:50.920 --> 29:51.830
Green lotus?

29:53.750 --> 29:55.030
That was Master.

29:57.210 --> 29:58.070
Your master?

30:01.480 --> 30:05.240
Master practiced the Green Lotus Swordsmanship.

30:06.070 --> 30:07.720
When he traveled the mortal realm,

30:08.160 --> 30:11.750
people called him Green Lotus Sword Immortal.

30:13.580 --> 30:14.380
Now that I think of it,

30:15.740 --> 30:17.540
back in Baitou Mountain,

30:19.300 --> 30:21.460
he already knew what you would go through,

30:22.640 --> 30:24.600
so he made an excuse out of the gift,

30:24.960 --> 30:26.200
and gave you a hit.

30:27.440 --> 30:29.000
He left some power in you

30:30.510 --> 30:31.680
to protect you.

30:43.270 --> 30:46.030
I'm sorry, Yuanzhong.

30:47.720 --> 30:48.750
Why are you apologizing?

30:50.110 --> 30:51.400
The Divine Left Hand

30:52.640 --> 30:53.830
was created by me.

30:54.160 --> 30:55.680
It brought so much

30:55.680 --> 30:57.160
misery to you.

31:00.880 --> 31:02.680
But it also ended the war

31:04.030 --> 31:05.400
and saved my life.

31:07.640 --> 31:09.310
If you hadn't created it,

31:10.920 --> 31:12.440
I wouldn't have met you.

31:13.440 --> 31:14.750
When there is a cause, there is an effect.

31:16.200 --> 31:17.350
It's destiny.

31:25.640 --> 31:26.830
I'm feeling sleepy.

31:31.400 --> 31:33.640
I don't think I can see Curly again.

31:40.160 --> 31:41.750
I was so silly.

31:43.640 --> 31:44.440
Back then,

31:45.400 --> 31:46.310
I shouldn't have

31:46.310 --> 31:48.110
made those three vows.

31:51.200 --> 31:53.030
But if I hadn't,

31:55.240 --> 31:57.400
none of the incidents after that would've happened.

32:06.750 --> 32:07.550
Yuanzhong,

32:09.880 --> 32:12.640
I've had so much fun during these days.

32:14.200 --> 32:16.680
I have had such a long life.

32:19.110 --> 32:19.920
Actually,

32:21.310 --> 32:23.030
I've always been doing quite well.

32:25.480 --> 32:27.160
But since I met you,

32:30.240 --> 32:31.790
there has been more joy in my life.

32:34.000 --> 32:34.790
So,

32:36.480 --> 32:37.200
just remember

32:37.200 --> 32:38.880
the cheerful side of me.

33:00.480 --> 33:01.480
No need to fear.

33:03.640 --> 33:05.030
My departure shouldn't bother you.

33:05.400 --> 33:06.720
I won't be away.

33:08.450 --> 33:09.820
I'll always be around.

33:11.350 --> 33:12.790
In the future,

33:14.500 --> 33:17.650
when you see a butterfly on the handle of your sword,

33:19.700 --> 33:20.570
a little mouse

33:21.350 --> 33:23.590
running to you in the fields,

33:24.440 --> 33:27.110
or a small bug that gives you

33:27.110 --> 33:28.750
a gentle bite in summer,

33:27.260 --> 33:30.730
♫Going through thousands of years♫

33:29.880 --> 33:30.880
you will know

33:31.270 --> 33:33.480
that I've told them to visit you.

33:31.330 --> 33:34.510
♫In exchange for a dreamlike love♫

33:34.350 --> 33:35.680
They'll be with you when you're sad or happy,

33:35.330 --> 33:38.000
♫If the wind is all yours♫

33:37.160 --> 33:38.440
and when you make progress

33:38.420 --> 33:42.420
♫No bitterness in your expression♫

33:39.270 --> 33:40.960
in all four seasons.

33:42.940 --> 33:45.920
♫Everyone comes without a match♫

33:45.640 --> 33:46.310
Is it true?

33:46.180 --> 33:50.740
♫Why are they willing to be gentle?♫

33:48.640 --> 33:49.440
Yes.

33:50.910 --> 33:53.970
♫The moment your image appeared in my eyes♫

33:51.000 --> 33:52.750
I will always be with you.

33:54.600 --> 33:57.720
♫The answer appeared♫

33:56.510 --> 33:58.350
I will always be with you.

33:58.580 --> 34:01.970
♫But time♫

34:02.400 --> 34:05.810
♫Always hides the waves and smoke♫

34:06.320 --> 34:10.190
♫Under the clouds, the good days♫

34:10.440 --> 34:14.080
♫Come and go in a flash♫

34:16.060 --> 34:19.690
♫Like the wind and moon, I'm filled with love♫

34:20.030 --> 34:23.469
♫But it makes people go to the end of the world♫

34:23.889 --> 34:27.760
♫Willingly going through dawn and dusk♫

34:27.960 --> 34:31.260
♫To embrace you and listen to the rain♫

34:31.780 --> 34:35.010
♫Only then can I know what is memorable♫

34:35.719 --> 34:39.340
♫When I can only look back at you♫

34:39.760 --> 34:43.570
♫If there's still a way to continue♫

34:43.590 --> 34:48.310
♫I'll go no matter what♫

35:12.940 --> 35:16.180
♫Like the wind and moon, I'm filled with love♫

35:16.870 --> 35:20.140
♫But it makes people go to the end of the world♫

35:20.700 --> 35:24.830
♫Willingly going through dawn and dusk♫

35:24.850 --> 35:28.140
♫To embrace you and listen to the rain♫

35:28.590 --> 35:32.340
♫Only then can I know what is memorable♫

35:32.370 --> 35:36.040
♫When I can only look back at you♫

35:36.440 --> 35:40.220
♫If there's still a way to continue♫

35:40.240 --> 35:44.800
♫I'll go no matter what♫

35:46.220 --> 35:51.530
♫I'll go no matter what♫

36:08.770 --> 36:14.290
[Fragrant House]

36:17.230 --> 36:18.040
Xiu!

36:18.190 --> 36:19.480
You stole my gold again!

36:19.920 --> 36:20.880
Give it back to me!

36:21.210 --> 36:22.160
Xiu!

36:22.840 --> 36:23.930
You've eaten so much food,

36:23.960 --> 36:25.000
yet you're still so small.

36:25.470 --> 36:27.390
Xiu, stop running!

36:28.280 --> 36:29.740
-Give the gold back to me!
-Excuse me...

36:30.230 --> 36:31.220
Xiu!

36:33.590 --> 36:34.400
Xiu!

36:47.070 --> 36:48.440
Sir, are you

36:49.180 --> 36:51.140
the High Priest of Youhu Clan,

36:51.360 --> 36:52.150
Yuanzhong?

36:56.000 --> 36:56.960
Who are you?

36:57.230 --> 36:58.550
I'm from the Divine Realm.

36:58.880 --> 37:00.480
I'm your guide back.

37:03.070 --> 37:04.000
You should leave.

37:05.000 --> 37:05.800
Why?

37:07.230 --> 37:08.440
I don't want to go to the Divine Realm.

37:09.440 --> 37:10.480
How come?

37:11.070 --> 37:12.070
To be honest,

37:12.280 --> 37:14.710
the whole Divine Realm is expecting

37:14.710 --> 37:16.030
your presence.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.510
Why won't you go there?

37:18.280 --> 37:19.230
Do they want to see me,

37:20.110 --> 37:21.630
or the Divine Hand?

37:22.110 --> 37:23.190
Both.

37:23.480 --> 37:24.760
Both.

37:25.510 --> 37:27.230
The Divine Hand means a lot to me.

37:27.670 --> 37:28.710
I can't give it to you.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.070
You must be joking.

37:31.350 --> 37:32.350
The Divine Left Hand

37:32.380 --> 37:33.800
is yours only.

37:33.800 --> 37:35.440
None of the gods would ask for it.

37:35.510 --> 37:36.510
Even if you offer it,

37:37.130 --> 37:38.420
we wouldn't dare to accept it.

37:42.070 --> 37:43.140
You have inherited

37:43.160 --> 37:45.070
all the power of Deity Taihe.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.320
In the Heavenly Realm,

37:46.550 --> 37:48.440
you are most likely to become

37:48.440 --> 37:50.230
the next divine Primordial God.

37:50.440 --> 37:52.760
Primordial God practices magic that emotions can't affect.

37:53.230 --> 37:54.360
He has no desire and is purely clean.

37:54.630 --> 37:56.440
If you get chosen by primordial power,

37:56.550 --> 37:57.360
you will become

37:57.360 --> 37:58.880
the guardian of the Six Realms.

37:58.960 --> 37:59.760
By then,

37:59.840 --> 38:02.030
not only the laws of heaven will be under your control,

38:02.150 --> 38:04.190
but also all the gods will obey you.

38:04.320 --> 38:06.190
Don't you want any of those?

38:07.440 --> 38:08.320
I'm not interested.

38:09.050 --> 38:11.010
It takes time to cultivate interest.

38:14.860 --> 38:16.970
Don't you want to see Wushuang again?

38:23.400 --> 38:24.280
What did you just say?

38:25.150 --> 38:26.000
Wushuang's flesh

38:26.000 --> 38:27.320
has vanished,

38:27.630 --> 38:28.840
but her primordial spirit

38:29.360 --> 38:31.110
still sticks around.

38:31.630 --> 38:33.400
All the good deeds she did

38:33.400 --> 38:34.230
as the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

38:34.230 --> 38:35.590
gave her a chance

38:36.190 --> 38:38.070
of living.

38:39.110 --> 38:39.920
Are you saying

38:41.070 --> 38:42.280
that Wushuang is still alive?

38:44.840 --> 38:45.670
It depends on

38:45.960 --> 38:47.800
how you define

38:47.960 --> 38:49.190
"alive."

38:50.070 --> 38:52.510
Maybe she is a bird, a flower,

38:53.070 --> 38:54.400
a leaf,

38:54.920 --> 38:56.550
or just a breeze.

38:57.280 --> 38:59.230
She could be living in the morning, and be dead by night.

38:59.880 --> 39:01.880
Maybe she would stay undiscovered for a thousand years.

39:03.280 --> 39:05.030
In this bustling world,

39:05.710 --> 39:08.110
she could be like a butterfly out of her cocoon.

39:08.440 --> 39:09.550
She lives or dies in the ways I said.

39:10.190 --> 39:11.670
Are you okay with it?

39:54.320 --> 39:55.190
She's still around.

39:55.880 --> 39:56.670
Yes.

39:57.070 --> 39:59.280
She is in this bustling world.

40:05.130 --> 40:06.170
Your name is Ji Tanyin?

40:07.440 --> 40:08.760
You have a decent job as a craftsman.

40:09.230 --> 40:10.190
Why would you willingly

40:10.190 --> 40:11.710
work as a handmaid in Fangwai Mountain?

40:11.710 --> 40:12.510
I've long admired

40:12.510 --> 40:13.670
the High Priest of Youhu Clan,

40:13.670 --> 40:14.960
so I'd like to devote my life to serving him.

40:14.960 --> 40:15.760
Can't I do that?

40:16.880 --> 40:18.070
Tell me, Ji Tanyin.

40:18.550 --> 40:19.760
Will you work as a handmaid

40:19.760 --> 40:20.630
in Liujiao Palace?

40:20.780 --> 40:23.800
♫I lament the countless ups and downs♫

40:20.960 --> 40:23.280
Will you follow and wait on me?

40:24.030 --> 40:24.920
Yes, I will.

40:24.860 --> 40:30.920
♫The wind of fate disrupts my life♫

40:25.550 --> 40:26.320
Because now

40:26.320 --> 40:27.510
in this world,

40:27.510 --> 40:28.760
I have only one mission.

40:28.920 --> 40:30.190
And that is to be with you.

40:34.060 --> 40:37.170
♫What's real? What's fake?♫

40:34.510 --> 40:35.320
What are you doing?

40:36.510 --> 40:38.000
Until your hair turns grey,

40:38.180 --> 40:45.560
♫Good and evil blur together as I race through the mortal world♫

40:38.190 --> 40:39.230
your teeth all fall out,

40:39.510 --> 40:41.000
and you die of old age.

40:42.030 --> 40:43.550
I am the person who believes in you the most.

40:43.880 --> 40:45.400
I'm the one who, in your lifetime,

40:45.400 --> 40:47.190
will never betray you.

40:47.530 --> 40:50.530
♫Racing forward, scars all along the way♫

40:48.960 --> 40:50.440
Your life will end one day.

40:50.710 --> 40:52.070
I just want you to spend it happily.

40:51.140 --> 40:53.530
♫Yet my gaze stays firm and unwavering♫

40:54.300 --> 40:58.560
♫Cutting through this cold, bitter world♫

40:54.360 --> 40:55.840
When I was young, I saw someone

40:57.150 --> 40:58.360
who looked very much like you.

40:59.550 --> 41:01.070
Actually, we met

41:01.070 --> 41:02.110
a long time ago

41:01.250 --> 41:03.990
♫I may be as insignificant as dust♫

41:04.190 --> 41:05.800
It's a pity that after such a long time,

41:04.520 --> 41:07.510
♫But I still dare to fight the stars♫

41:07.880 --> 41:08.630
I can't remember

41:07.910 --> 41:13.100
♫With my unyielding soul♫

41:08.630 --> 41:09.670
her face.

41:10.030 --> 41:11.510
I saw your future.

41:12.230 --> 41:15.320
You'll spend the rest of your life with someone you love.

41:13.860 --> 41:18.650
♫When the world collapses♫

41:16.360 --> 41:17.840
Many will envy your life.

41:19.320 --> 41:20.110
In the end,

41:19.320 --> 41:25.900
♫I'll draw my sword for you, without a second thought♫

41:21.190 --> 41:22.590
you'll be happy and fulfilled.

41:23.630 --> 41:25.880
When you look back,

41:25.880 --> 41:27.670
you'll see a life filled with endless happiness.

41:27.380 --> 41:32.120
♫Fate is unpredictable like a flickering flame♫

41:28.480 --> 41:29.360
I love you.

41:30.360 --> 41:31.960
I love you very much.

41:32.510 --> 41:34.280
I once lived as a human, and now I'm a goddess.

41:32.940 --> 41:35.630
♫I wield love and hate like a blade♫

41:34.440 --> 41:35.320
Over these one thousand years,

41:35.320 --> 41:36.840
you're the only one I've been in love with.

41:35.870 --> 41:42.450
♫Fearlessly roaming across the world♫

41:40.400 --> 41:43.480
It's a large world. The circle of life never stops.

41:44.150 --> 41:45.960
In time,

41:46.550 --> 41:47.880
you will

41:48.630 --> 41:50.200
see her again one day.

41:55.300 --> 41:58.290
♫What's real? What's fake?♫

41:58.320 --> 41:59.190
You're right.

41:59.370 --> 42:06.450
♫Good and evil blur together as I race through the mortal world♫

42:00.840 --> 42:01.760
I believe

42:03.510 --> 42:05.280
we will meet again one day.

42:08.450 --> 42:11.560
♫Racing forward, scars all over my body♫

42:12.270 --> 42:14.970
♫Yet my gaze stays firm and unwavering♫

42:15.550 --> 42:20.110
♫Cutting through this cold, bitter world♫

42:16.480 --> 42:17.840
I'll be with you.

42:19.190 --> 42:20.000
Yuanzhong,

42:21.510 --> 42:23.150
I will always be with you.

42:22.190 --> 42:24.850
♫I may be as insignificant as dust♫

42:24.670 --> 42:26.280
Don't be afraid, Yuanzhong.

42:25.630 --> 42:28.460
♫But I still dare to fight the stars♫

42:27.070 --> 42:28.840
I'll be with you.

42:29.070 --> 42:33.960
♫With my unyielding soul♫

42:30.710 --> 42:33.550
Yuanzhong, I promise you

42:34.110 --> 42:35.590
that I will come back.

42:34.910 --> 42:39.760
♫Fate is unpredictable like a flickering flame♫

42:36.360 --> 42:37.960
No matter what happens,

42:38.630 --> 42:40.540
I will find my way back to you.

42:40.590 --> 42:43.320
♫I wield love and hate like a blade♫

42:41.510 --> 42:43.280
I will always be with you.

42:43.530 --> 42:49.400
♫Fearlessly roaming across the world♫

42:44.230 --> 42:45.630
That is my promise.

42:50.980 --> 42:55.440
[The End]
